<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_treasurechest02b.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Holy Priests in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>The phase 1 tier set bonuses aren't incredibly exciting, but are still a good enough increase that you will want to get your set as soon as possible.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">Tier 14 - <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item-set=1137/vestments-of-the-guardian-serpent">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vestments of the Guardian Serpent</span></a></span></h3>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
