<br/>Most of the power of the set comes from the 4 piece reducing the cooldown of <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=34861/circle-of-healing">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_circleofrenewal.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Circle of Healing</span></a>. Early on before <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6067/terrace-of-endless-spring">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Terrace of Endless Spring</span></a> opens you won't be able to get 4 pieces of tier so you shouldn't feel rushed to get it as the 2 piece bonus isn't very good overall but you will definitely want to complete it as soon as possible once the 4 piece is available.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Holy Priest Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>Most healer trinkets will be different flavor of stat sticks, so the choices are very simple and we pick whatever is tunned the highest and gives us the stats we want.<h5 class="heading-size-5" id="best-trinkets">Best Trinkets</h5>You should avoid having two active trinkets at the same time, but besides that feel free to use the best out of whatever options you manage to get your hands on.<br/>
<br/>
<ins>Passive Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86327/spirits-of-the-sun">
<img alt="Spirits of the Sun" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_drink_29_sunkissedwine.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spirits of the Sun</span></a> will be your best trinket for the phase. It is just a Intellect and Spirit stat stick.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=86147/qin-xis-polarizing-seal">
<img alt="Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trinketpanda_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Qin-xi's Polarizing Seal</span></a> very similar to the above but with the stats flipped around, a static Spirit trinket with an Intellect proc and your best option for the 2 trinket slot.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79330/relic-of-chi-ji">
<img alt="Relic of Chi-Ji" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_crane.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Chi-Ji</span></a> is another very good alternative and its easy to acquire (if potentially a bit expensive) being a darkmoon trinket. A very simple passive Intellect trinket that procs a Spirit buff</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81133/empty-fruit-barrel">
<img alt="Empty Fruit Barrel" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cask_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Empty Fruit Barrel</span></a> is tunned decently high as will be your best option from the dungeon drops.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=75274/zen-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Zen Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pet_scorchedstone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zen Alchemist Stone</span></a> another good pre-raid alternative but one that requires you to be an Alchemist. If you plan on grabbing the profession anyway then it is worth to get it but otherwise you shouldn't feel the need to change professions just for it as there are better options available.</div></li></ul>
<ins>Active Trinkets</ins>
<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89081/blossom-of-pure-snow">
<img alt="Blossom of Pure Snow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/item_herbd.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blossom of Pure Snow</span></a> is a decent option for active trinkets. It is a bit worse than the passive options but if you really want it you can guarantee that you will get it eventually as it comes from Shado-Pan reputation.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=81264/vial-of-ichorous-blood">
<img alt="Vial of Ichorous Blood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_08.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Vial of Ichorous Blood</span></a> another dungeon option you can target. With a very similar value then your other active option it is a good alternative if you can't get any of the passive trinkets but it is still a behind them in power.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c5" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Reputation for Holy Priests in Phase 1</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Holy Priest, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1341/the-august-celestials">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The August Celestials</span></a> and then <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a>. <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1341/the-august-celestials">
<span class="tinyicontxt">The August Celestials</span></a> will give you access to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=88892/bracers-of-inlaid-jade">
<img alt="Bracers of Inlaid Jade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of Inlaid Jade</span></a> which are the best bracers you can get until <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/zone=6297/heart-of-fear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Fear</span></a> releases.<br/>
<br/>As for <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1269/golden-lotus">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Golden Lotus</span></a> the chest piece is the ideal slot to wear your tier set off piece in favor of something with better stats, on top of being a slot that has a bigger stat budget making item level gains more valuable. This makes <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89434/robe-of-the-five-sisters">
